# Business Rules

## Household

- Household is the root of all data.
- All entities must have `householdId`.
- Household must always have at least one Owner.

---

## Owner

The user who creates the Household automatically becomes the first Owner.

---

## Access

Users may only access Households they are members of.

---

## Initialization

Household is only created once during onboarding.

---

# Functional Requirements

## Create Household

User can create a Household by entering:

- Household Name

After success:

- Household is created.
- User becomes Owner.
- Household becomes the active Household.

---

## Get Active Household

The application can retrieve the active Household for the current user.

---

## Update Household

Owner can change the Household name.

---

# Validation

## Household Name

- Required.
- Minimum 3 characters.
- Maximum 50 characters.
- Trim whitespace before saving.

---

# Permission

| Action            | Owner | Member |
| ----------------- | :---: | :----: |
| View Household    |  ✅   |   ✅   |
| Rename Household  |  ✅   |   ❌   |

