# Empty State

## No Household yet

Title

> Welcome to Kin Finance

Description

> Create your Household to start managing your family's finances.

Primary Action

> Create Household

---

# Error State

Show messages that are easy to understand.

Examples:

- Failed to create household.
- Household name is invalid.
- Please try again.

Do not show technical backend errors.

---

# Success Criteria

Feature is considered complete when:

- User can create a Household.
- Household automatically becomes the active Household.
- User automatically becomes Owner.
- Owner can rename the Household.
- User cannot access other Households.
- Validation works correctly.
- Empty State is available.
- Error State is available.

